  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TradeMark Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall objective is to contribute to the competitiveness and climate resilience of Uganda&#x2019;s trade and export value chains. The project strategy will be cross sectoral and will involve coordination of several public institutions and private actors. The aim is to build climate proofed and gender and disability-responsive physical trade infrastructure as well as enhance institutional capacity at national and private sector level to facilitate more competitive exports and market access in the region and internationally for Uganda&#x2019;s priority agricultural exports.</narrative>
  </description>
